WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.380
Hello, I'm Alexa Chung

00:00:01.381 --> 00:00:02.780
We're here at the Dior show,

00:00:02.781 --> 00:00:05.180
in a conservatory, essentially,

00:00:05.181 --> 00:00:08.260
and it's boiling and I've got bright sunshine in my face

00:00:08.261 --> 00:00:10.660
What is the first song you play in the morning?

00:00:10.661 --> 00:00:12.580
I actually listen to Radio 4 in the morning,

00:00:12.581 --> 00:00:14.380
because I find it really soothing

00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:15.780
Then at the moment, I can't stop,

00:00:15.781 --> 00:00:19.066
listening to “How Do You Sleep at Night” by John Lennon
